                                        <p data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1000">Our QuickCool Installation service provides fast and efficient installation of new air conditioning units. Our certified technicians will ensure your system is air an installed correctly and safely,</p>
                                        <div class="row">
                                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                                <div class="axis-info-box style-one mb-30" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1000">
                                                    <div class="icon">
                                                        <i class="far fa-map-marker-alt"></i>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="content">
                                                        <h5>Our Address</h5>
                                                        <p>374 William S Canning Blvd, Fall River MA 2721, USA</p>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                                <div class="axis-info-box style-one mb-30" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1200">
                                                    <div class="icon">
                                                        <i class="far fa-map-marker-alt"></i>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="content">
                                                        <h5>Contact Number</h5>
                                                        <p><a href="tel:+(132)-1732-2978">+(132)-1732-2978</a></p>
                                                        <p><a href="tel:+(132)-1732-2978">+(163)-5565-0697</a></p>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                                <div class="axis-info-box style-one mb-30" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1400">
                                                    <div class="icon">
                                                        <i class="far fa-map-marker-alt"></i>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="content">
                                                        <h5>Email Address</h5>
                                                        <p><a href="mailto:axishelp@gmail.com">axishelp@gmail.com</a></p>
                                                        <p><a href="mailto:Info@yourdomain.com">Info@yourdomain.com</a></p>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                                <div class="axis-info-box style-one mb-30" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1600">
                                                    <div class="icon">
                                                        <i class="far fa-map-marker-alt"></i>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="content">
                                                        <h5>Our Address</h5>
                                                        <p>Mon - Sat: 9:00 - 18:00</p>
                                                        <p>Sunday: Closed</p>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="social-box-wrap" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1800">
